{"projectInfo":{"name":"OSPF发布聚合路由配置举例（交换）","path":"ospfjuhe","visibility":2,"categoryId":6280,"introduction":"SWA和SWB位于AS 200内，AS 200内使用OSPF作为IGP协议。SWC、SWD和SWE位于AS 100内，AS 100内使用OSPF作为IGP协议。SWB和SWC之间建立EBGP连接，配置BGP引入OSPF和直连路由，配置OSPF进程引入BGP路由。为了减小SWA的路由表规模，在SWB上配置路由聚合，只发布聚合后的路由10.0.0.0/8。。","label":["OSPF","聚合路由"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SWA","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWC","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWB","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWE","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWE.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWD","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"S6850_6","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\S6850_6.cfg"},{"resourceName":"S6850_7","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\S6850_7.cfg"}]}